{"sourceUrl":"https://xwcm.swu.edu.cn/info/1072/3804.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:28.097944+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://xwcm.swu.edu.cn/info/1072/3804.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>西南大学热忱欢迎全国优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免（初）试攻读我校硕士研究生！为做好接收</span>2027<span>年优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免（初）试攻读研究生（以下简称推免生）工作，我院将开展接收推免生预报名工作，欢迎广大推免生报名！</span></span></p>\n<p><span>一、</span><span>报名</span><span>条件</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）具有推免资格的本科培养单位推荐的、具有免（初）试攻读研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力倾向。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（四）诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（五）身心健康，符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>二、</span><span>报名</span><span>专业</span></p>\n<p><span><span>我院在</span></span><span><span>“</span><span>西南大学</span><span>2027</span><span>年接收推免生预报名系统</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span>http://swu.yjszsw.cn/tm/</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>可选报的</span></span><span><span>全日制硕士招生专业均可接收硕士推免生</span></span><span><span>；</span></span><span><span>最终以</span><span>“</span><span>教育部推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>填报专业为准</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>三、</span><span>报名和复试</span><span>程序</span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>一</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名程序</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span>.</span><span><span>报名时间：</span></span><span>2026<span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>日至</span>9<span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span>中午</span><span>1</span><span><span>2</span></span><span>:00<span>前</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span>.</span><span><span>凡符合上述</span></span><span><span>报名</span></span><span><span>条件且有意愿报考我校的优秀应届本科毕业生（包括本校和外校），请于报名时间内登录</span><span>“</span><span>西南大学</span></span><span>2027</span><span><span>年接收推免生预报名系统</span><span>”</span><span>（</span><span>http://swu.yjszsw.cn/tm/</span><span>），</span></span><span><span>按要求上传相关材料</span></span><span><span>并</span></span><span><span>完成报名信息</span></span><span><span>提交</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>报名所需提交相关材料如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）本人身份证正反面扫描件</span></span><span>（复试提供原件）</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）本人学生证正反面扫描件</span></span><span>（复试提供原件）</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>3<span>）西南大学推荐免</span><span>(</span><span>初</span><span>)</span><span>试攻读硕士研究生申请表（填写完整后打印，签字盖章后扫描成</span><span>PDF</span><span>格式）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>4<span>）西南大学推荐免</span><span>(</span><span>初</span><span>)</span><span>试硕士考生诚信复试承诺书（本人签字后扫描成</span><span>PDF</span><span>格式）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>5<span>）西南大学推荐免</span><span>(</span><span>初</span><span>)</span><span>试攻读硕士研究生复试思想政治考核自评表（培养单位联系人辅导员或组织员签字，加盖培养单位党章；填写完整后打印，签字盖章后扫描成</span><span>PDF</span><span>格式）</span></span><span><br/></span><span>   <span>（</span>6<span>）大学学习成绩单（加盖教务处公章）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>7<span>）（如果有）外语水平测试成绩单（大学英语四六级、大学英语专业四八级、托福、雅思等）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>8<span>）（如果有）获奖证书、发表学术论文等证明材料</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>其中</span>3-5<span>号表格可在附件</span><span>2 </span><span>其他附件包内下载。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>要求：</span></span><strong><span><span>申请者备齐</span>1-8<span>号材料后，上传文件按照顺序扫描合并成</span><span>1</span><span>个</span><span>pdf</span><span>文件且</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>大小不要超过</span>8M</span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>命名格式为：</span><span>“</span><span>预推免</span><span>+</span><span>姓名</span><span>+</span><span>本科毕业学校</span><span>+</span><span>报考专业</span><span>+</span><span>联系电话</span><span>”</span></span></strong><span><span>（例如，预推免</span>+<span>李某</span><span>+</span><span>某某大学</span><span>+</span><span>报考西大新闻传播学学硕</span><span>/</span><span>新闻与传播专硕</span><span>/</span><span>艺术学学硕</span><span>/</span><span>戏剧与影视专硕</span><span>+188******</span><span>）</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>特别注意：</span></span></strong><span><span>提交以上材料的同时，请将以下</span>2<span>个材料：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）</span></span><strong><span><span><span>附件</span>3 <span>预推免基本信息表</span></span></span></strong><span><span>（命名格式为：</span><span>“</span><span>附件</span><span>3 </span><span>预推免基本信息表</span><span>+</span><span>姓名</span><span>+</span><span>本科毕业学校</span><span>+</span><span>报考专业</span><span>”</span><span>）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）</span></span><strong><span><span><span>所在高校的推免资格证明材料</span></span></span></strong><span><span>（如所在学校尚未公示推免资格，可暂不提交，在推免复试前补交）</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>于</span>2026<span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>2</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日前发送到邮箱</span>1765415883@qq.com<span>。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>二</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>复试安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>学院</span></span><span><span>将对</span></span><span><span>考生</span></span><span><span>提交的所有材料进行审查</span></span><span><span>，择优确定</span></span><span><span>复试名单并发出通知，请考生及时关注</span></span><span><span>“</span><span>西南大学</span></span><span>2027</span><span><span>年接收推免生预报名系统</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>站内消息并保持手机畅通。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.<span>复试时间</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>预计报到时间暂定为</span></span><span><span>9<span>月</span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>日下午</span></span></span><span><span>，面试时间暂定为</span></span><span><span>9<span>月</span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span>，具体时间以最终通知为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.<span>预推免进群</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>为方便联系和通知，请拟申请我院</span>2027<span>级推免生的同学加入</span></span><strong><span>QQ<span>群：</span><span>296982432</span></span></strong><span><span>（进群请修改备注名为：本科学校</span>+<span>姓名</span><span>+</span><span>报考专业）</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>复试方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>线下综合面试。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4</span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>复试内容</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试内容包括思想道德水平考核、外语水平测试、专业素养考核、科研潜力、综合素质考核等内容，满分为</span>100<span>分。面试分数低于</span><span>60</span><span>分为不合格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>四、其他事项</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）</span></span><span><span>申请人提交的全部材料必须保证真实准确，若弄虚作假，一经发现，立即取消其接收推免申请资格</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>已在我校</span></span><span>“</span><span><span>西南大学</span></span><span>2027</span><span><span>年接收推免生预报名系统</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>预</span></span><span><span>报名的</span></span><span><span>考生</span></span><span><span>届时还</span></span><span><span>应</span></span><span><span>通过教育部</span><span>“</span><span>全国推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>注册并填报志愿，</span></span><span><span>并在学院规定时间内</span></span><span><span>按工作程序完成招生流程</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>具体流程如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span>.</span><span><span>通过预推免复试的推免生在推免系统开通的</span>24<span>小时内登录中国研招网</span><span>“</span><span>全国推免生服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>填报志愿。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span>.</span><span><span>学院通过中国研招网</span><span>“</span><span>全国推免生服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>发复试通知，推免生接收复试通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span>.</span><span><span>学院通过研招网发待录取通知，推免生接收待录取。推免生接收工作结束。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>特别提醒：</span></span><span><span>通过复试的推免生须按要求</span></span><span>在规定时间内</span><span><span>在中国研招网接收待录取通知，</span></span><span>若放弃，</span><span><span>拟录取资格由排名靠后的同学依次递补。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>“</span><span>全国推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>网址为：</span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/<span>，预计</span>9<span>月下旬开放报名，请申请人关注中国研究生招生信息网和</span></span><span><span>学院官网</span></span><span><span>通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>我校将根据教育部</span></span><span><span>的</span></span><span><span>最新推免政策</span></span><span><span>和学校相关文件要求</span></span><span><span>及时公布</span></span><span><span>西南</span></span><span><span>大学</span></span><span>2027</span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>接收推免生章程</span></span><span><span>及其他相关信息，</span></span><span><span>请</span></span><span><span>关注</span></span><span><span>西南大学研招网和学院官网</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>五、接收推免工作联系方式</span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：郑老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span>023-68252070<span>，邮箱：</span><span>1765415883@qq.com</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系地址：西南大学第</span>4<span>教学楼</span><span>106</span><span>办公室</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>                               <span>西南大学新闻传媒学院</span>     </span></p>\n<p><span>2026<span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>附件：</span><span></span></p>\n<p><span><span> <span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://xwcm.swu.edu.cn/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://xwcm.swu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&amp;owner=1924771276&amp;wbfileid=E92D20C42A99A3286F76081F32D9A104\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1.西南大学2027年接收推免生预报名系统操作步骤（考生端）.docx</a></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span> <span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://xwcm.swu.edu.cn/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\"/><a href=\"https://xwcm.swu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&amp;owner=1924771276&amp;wbfileid=9C4BFF54CA56297704BD3F4A734904E0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2.其他附件包.zip</a></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span> <span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://xwcm.swu.edu.cn/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_xls.gif\"/><a href=\"https://xwcm.swu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&amp;owner=1924771276&amp;wbfileid=D348D82832D47F43C7E65884310B0816\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件3.预推免基本信息表.xlsx</a></span></span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"fca938a1583d6becd279eadbf49c64b1b72a3bd2ae5ac3a52d7f3e4e179260d5","textLength":2076,"sourceSha256":"34c21b7afc23cc8102ec6f885435edd122bae3be024d821a5a05565e09e7daa8","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-7f517a8a20390b99afad","title":"2026年西南大学新闻传媒学院关于接收2027年优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免（初）试攻读研究生的预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:28.097944+00:00"}
